                            立即選購
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 col-xl-3 wow fadeInRight"
             data-wow-delay="0.1s">
            <div class="carousel-header-banner h-100">
                <img src="~/lib/home/img/header-img.jpg"
                     class="img-fluid w-100 h-100"
                     style="object-fit: cover"
                     alt="圖片" />
                <div class="carousel-banner-offer">
                    <p class="bg-primary text-white rounded fs-5 py-2 px-4 mb-0 me-3">
                        省下 $48.00
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-primary fs-5 fw-bold mb-0">特別優惠</p>
                </div>
                <div class="carousel-banner">
                    <div class="carousel-banner-content text-center p-4">
                        <a href="#" class="d-block mb-2">智慧型手機</a>
                        <a href="#" class="d-block text-white fs-3">
                            Apple iPad Mini <br />
                            G2356
